. *-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
. * Cleaning GDRP
. *-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
. 
. *----- Nominal GDRP Data -----*
. import excel "$data/PDRB Seluruh Provinsi ADHK 2010-2025.xlsx", sheet("Level") firstrow clear
{res}{text}(66 vars, 34 obs)

{com}. 
. reshape long year_, i(prov) j(period, string)
{res}{txt}(j = 2010_12 2010_3 2010_6 2010_9 2011_12 2011_3 2011_6 2011_9 2012_12 2012_3 2012_6 2012_9 2013_12 2013_3 2013_6 2013_9 2014_12 2014_3 2014_6 2014_9 2015_12 2015_3 2015_6 2015_9 2016_12 2016_3 2016_6 2016_9 2017_12 2017_3 2017_6 2017_9 2018_12 2018_3 2018_6 2018_9 2019_12 2019_3 2019_6 2019_9 2020_12 2020_3 2020_6 2020_9 2021_12 2021_3 2021_6 2021_9 2022_12 2022_3 2022_6 2022_9 2023_12 2023_3 2023_6 2023_9 2024_12 2024_3 2024_6 2024_9 2025_12 2025_3 2025_6 2025_9)

Data{col 36}Wide{col 43}->{col 48}Long
{hline 77}
Number of observations     {res}          34   {txt}->   {res}2,176       
{txt}Number of variables        {res}          66   {txt}->   {res}4           
{txt}j variable (64 values)                    ->   {res}period
{txt}xij variables:
{res}year_2010_12 year_2010_3 ... year_2025_9  {txt}->   {res}year_
{txt}{hline 77}

{com}. ren year_ pdrb
{res}{txt}
{com}. gen year = substr(period, 1,4)
{txt}
{com}. gen quarter = substr(period, 6, 7)
{txt}
{com}. destring year quarter, replace
{txt}year: all characters numeric; {res}replaced {txt}as {res}int
{txt}quarter: all characters numeric; {res}replaced {txt}as {res}byte
{txt}
{com}. encode period, gen(period_num)
{txt}
{com}. 
. 
. gen yr = real(substr(period,1,4))
{txt}
{com}. gen mon = real(substr(period,6,.))      // 3,6,9,12
{txt}
{com}. gen qnum = mon/3                         // 1,2,3,4
{txt}
{com}. gen period2 = yq(yr, qnum)
{txt}
{com}. format period2 %tq
{txt}
{com}. 
. tempfile nominal
{txt}
{com}. save `nominal'
{txt}{p 0 4 2}
